# ---- Claude Code ----
# Nothing under .claude/ is published. It is per-machine or per-session — agent worktrees (multi-GB
# checkouts), local permission overrides, session state — plus the project skills, which are kept
# private. `CLAUDE.md` at the repo root IS published: it is the map the docs and the source comments
# point at.
.claude/
.remember/

# ---- Unpublished record ----
# These are the raw probe sessions and the 2.0 competitive analysis. They are the evidence the
# findings in docs/PLATFORM-CONSTRAINTS.md and docs/TRAPS.md were distilled from, and those two
# files — which ARE published — carry every finding that survived, with its date and its control.
# Kept out of the public repo because they are a session-by-session working record rather than
# documentation, and because PLAN-2.0.md is a competitor teardown.
#
# They still live on disk. `Tools/private-sync.sh` backs them up to the private repo.
docs/PROBES-2.0.md
docs/PROBE-*.md
docs/PLAN-2.0.md
docs/NEXT-SESSION.md
docs/BRIEF.md

# The private repo's git directory, used by Tools/private-sync.sh.
.private.git/
